// self-hosted::compiler::render_native_compile_driver_stable
//
// Minimal native compile driver. Inlines load_module_file to avoid
// importing module_loader.sio (~3900 lines of JIT overhead).
// Pipeline: parse → flat summary (once) → per-body lower+compile → ELF → write
//
// Usage:
//   souc run self-hosted/compiler/render_native_compile_driver_stable.sio -- <source> <output>

